r_style="2">Power J1 from regulated 3.3 V. The TMP75 uses I²C address 0x48.J2 exposes 3.3 V UART levels. Use J1 ground as the serial adapter return. Ground BOOT while pulsing EN low to enter the downloader.</NOTE_TEXT><JUNCTION pos="72,106"/></TinyCAD><DSNSETTINGS><SHOW_RULERS>1</SHOW_RULERS></DSNSETTINGS><NETLIST_TYPES><TYPE name="default"/></NETLIST_TYPES></TinyCADSheets>